Type: Project
Package: sleepandstrength
Title: Sleep Duration and Physical Strength Across the Lifespan (CDC NHANES 2011-2014)
Version: 0.2.0
Description: Reproducible Quarto website investigating relationships between nightly sleep duration and objective isometric grip strength across ages 16-80+ using CDC NHANES 2011-2014 data and complex multistage survey design.
